{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24816","headline":"赋得行不由径 · 王炎","name":"赋得行不由径","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邪径趋时捷，端心恶此名。\n长衢贵高步，大路自规行。\n且虑萦纡僻，将求坦荡情。\n讵同流俗好，方保立身贞。\n远迹如违险，修仁在履平。\n始知夫子道，从此得坚诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王炎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}